{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2023-03-30 09:30:00', 'title': 'PUTTSHACK CONTINUES EXPANSION IN THE MIDWEST WITH SECOND LOCATION NEAR THE TWIN CITIES', 'text': "NEW UPSCALE TECH-INFUSED MINI GOLF EXPERIENCE TO OPEN AT SOUTHDALE CENTER IN THE MINNEAPOLIS METROPOLITAN AREA MINNEAPOLIS , MARCH 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PUTTSHACK, THE WORLD'S FIRST AND ONLY UPSCALE TECH-INFUSED MINI GOLF EXPERIENCE, TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED ITS CONTINUED EXPANSION IN MINNESOTA WITH THE SIGNING OF A NEW LEASE AT SOUTHDALE CENTER, A PREMIER RETAIL DESTINATION IN THE SUBURBS OF THE TWIN CITIES. LOCATED AT 2004 SOUTHDALE CENTER IN EDINA, MINN."}{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2023-03-30 09:00:00', 'title': 'SIMON® AND JOSÉ ANDRÉS GROUP COLLABORATE TO BRING DINING TO PREMIER PROPERTIES', 'text': "THREE NEW RESTAURANTS – INCLUDING ZAYTINYA – TO DEBUT AT PREMIER LOCATIONS IN LAS VEGAS AND PALO ALTO INDIANAPOLIS , MARCH 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JOSÉ ANDRÉS GROUP\xa0(JAG) AND SIMON® \xa0HAVE ANNOUNCED THAT THEY WILL COLLABORATE TO BRING AWARD-WINNING RESTAURANTS TO SEVERAL OF SIMON'S PREMIER PROPERTIES.\xa0 JAG WILL ENTER NEW MARKETS AND EXPAND ITS FOOTPRINT IN EXISTING ANCHOR CITIES\xa0BY INTRODUCING UNPARALLELED CULINARY EXPERIENCES AT STANFORD SHOPPING CENTER, IN PALO ALTO, THE SHOPS AT CRYSTALS, AND INTRODUCING ZAYTINYA TO THE FORUM SHOPS AT CAESARS PALACE IN LAS VEGAS."}